---
const { pathname } = Astro.url;
const normalizedPathName = pathname.length > 1 && pathname.endsWith("/") ? pathname.slice(0, -1) : pathname;
---
<div class="w-full h-auto flex items-center place-content-center">
    <section class="max-w-2xl w-full h-max p-10 mx-auto my-auto flex flex-col items-center">
        <span class="fill-azul mx-auto text-center w-52 h-w-52">
            <svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" class="w-52 h-w-52" viewBox="0 -960 960 960">
                <path d="M234-276q51-39 114-61t132-23q69 0 132 23t114 61q35-41 55-93t19-111q0-133-93-226t-227-94q-133 0-226 94t-94 226q0 59 20 111t54 93Zm246-164q-59 0-99-40t-41-100q0-59 41-99t99-41q59 0 100 41t40 99q0 59-40 100t-100 40Zm0 360q-83 0-156-31t-127-86q-54-54-85-127T80-480q0-83 32-156t85-127q54-54 127-85t156-32q83 0 156 32t127 85q54 54 86 127t31 156q0 83-31 156t-86 127q-54 54-127 86T480-80Zm0-80q53 0 100-15t86-45q-39-29-86-44t-100-16q-53 0-100 16t-86 44q39 29 86 45t100 15Zm0-360q26 0 43-17t17-43q0-26-17-43t-43-17q-26 0-43 17t-17 43q0 26 17 43t43 17Zm0-60Zm0 360Z"/>
              </svg>
        </span>
        <h2 class=" w-full text-center text-accent font-bold text-5xl">Sessió No Iniciada</h2>
        
        <p class="text-blanco text-xl text-center my-2">
            No s'ha iniciat la sessió o no s'ha pogut trobar. Per favor, torna a iniciar-la a <a href={`/iniciar-sesion?redirect="${normalizedPathName}"`} class="text-amarillo hover:underline transition-all duration-300">iniciar sessió</a>.
        </p>
        
            <a href="/" class="px-3 py-2 w-max mx-auto my-5 text-azul font-semibold bg-amarillo rounded-full text-xl hover:scale-110 duration-300 transition-all transform flex flex-row items-center place-content-center gap-1">
                <svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="20" height="20" fill="currentColor" viewBox="0 -960 960 960" class="fill-current">
                    <path d="M313-440l224 224-57 56-320-320 320-320 57 56-224 224h487v80H313Z"/>
                </svg>
                Tornar enrere
            </a>
        </section>
</div>
